---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What data SoloStack collects and how it is used."
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</em></p>
  <p>
    This is a starting template — replace the placeholders below with your actual analytics, email, and
    hosting providers before publishing, and have it reviewed if you plan to process EU visitor data
    (GDPR) or collect emails.
  </p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We use privacy-respecting analytics (e.g. Plausible or Fathom) to understand which articles are
    useful, without tracking individuals across the web or storing personal data by default. If you
    subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address via [YOUR EMAIL PROVIDER — e.g. Kit],
    solely to send you updates you've asked for. You can unsubscribe at any time.
  </p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    Some affiliate links use tracking cookies set by the destination company, not by SoloStack, so that
    they can credit us for a signup that originated on this site.
  </p>
  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>We do not sell visitor data. Affiliate partners and analytics/email providers are listed above.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:hello@solostack.io">hello@solostack.io</a></p>
</BaseLayout>
